<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 30 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 200, tin down 5, lead down 525, zinc up 1550, aluminium down 4250, nickel up 1092, aluminium alloy down 140</p>
</text>
